      "filename": "Oddo&Doddo SaxonFoundersOf TewkesburyAbbey.jpg",
      "title": "File:Oddo&Doddo SaxonFoundersOf TewkesburyAbbey.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/de/Oddo%26Doddo_SaxonFoundersOf_TewkesburyAbbey.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Oddo%26Doddo_SaxonFoundersOf_TewkesburyAbbey.jpg",
